('node-7-15', 'phase-07-lesson-15-kubernetes-architecture-control-plane-int', 'module-10', 15, 'Lesson 10.15: Kubernetes Architecture & Control Plane Internals', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 7.10, Lesson 7.13', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 7.10, Lesson 7.13 | Subtopics: 6 items', 'Systems project application', 240, 8, 1750.0, 750.0, '# Lesson 7.15: Kubernetes Architecture & Control Plane Internals

- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
- **Prerequisites**: Lesson 7.10, Lesson 7.13
- **Subtopics**:
